{"4221820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Die for Pay", "steam_appid": 4221820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Die for Pay is a CO-OP Multiplayer action crime game about rising in an open world where nightly riots erupt and people kill without mercy. Take risks, make money through illegal means, gather your crew. When the siren sounds, curfew begins, and so does the carnage.</strong><br><br><strong>Day: Build Your Empire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You start with nothing but a small warehouse, an old pistol, and the last cash in your pocket.<br>Set up your machines, produce illegal goods, and sell them on the streets.<br>Buy contraband cheap from smugglers and sell it high on the market.<br>Track orders coming through your phone, meet with customers, expand your network.<br>Every dollar takes you one step higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hire gangsters, grow your crew. Take control of your territory.<br> <br><strong>INCREDIBLE GRAPHICS</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221820/extras/af15ccac2feda7ce2d3e0b7d3059c493.poster.avif?t=1785319296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221820/extras/af15ccac2feda7ce2d3e0b7d3059c493.webm?t=1785319296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221820/extras/af15ccac2feda7ce2d3e0b7d3059c493.mp4?t=1785319296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>STUNNING VIEW</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221820/extras/2bb96e36c2096c15939ad7871c71b222.poster.avif?t=1785319296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221820/extras/2bb96e36c2096c15939ad7871c71b222.webm?t=1785319296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221820/extras/2bb96e36c2096c15939ad7871c71b222.mp4?t=1785319296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Night: Survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When the siren wails, the curfew announcement echoes through every street.<br>Masked gangs, chains and bats, barking pitbulls… violence roams the city.<br>And tonight, they’re coming for your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Protect your territory, reinforce your walls.<br>Position your crew in the right places. The resistance will be brutal.<br>Survive until sunrise.<br><strong>Remember: chaos is not freedom.</strong> Every crime has a cost, even at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Multiplayer</strong><br>Build your empire with friends and fight off the night assaults together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Production &amp; Trade</strong><br>Set up machines, produce goods, sell on the streets. Learn the market, multiply your profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building</strong><br>Expand your warehouse, strengthen your walls, set up your defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightly Riots</strong><br>Every night, they’ll be back at your door. Prepare while it’s still daylight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story of Rise</strong><br>Start with nothing. Become the king of the streets.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Die for Pay is a CO-OP Multiplayer action crime game about rising in an open world where nightly riots erupt and people kill without mercy. Take risks, make money through illegal means, gather your crew. When the siren sounds, curfew begins, and so does the carnage.</strong><br><br><strong>Day: Build Your Empire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You start with nothing but a small warehouse, an old pistol, and the last cash in your pocket.<br>Set up your machines, produce illegal goods, and sell them on the streets.<br>Buy contraband cheap from smugglers and sell it high on the market.<br>Track orders coming through your phone, meet with customers, expand your network.<br>Every dollar takes you one step higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hire gangsters, grow your crew. Take control of your territory.<br> <br><strong>INCREDIBLE GRAPHICS</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221820/extras/af15ccac2feda7ce2d3e0b7d3059c493.poster.avif?t=1785319296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221820/extras/af15ccac2feda7ce2d3e0b7d3059c493.webm?t=1785319296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221820/extras/af15ccac2feda7ce2d3e0b7d3059c493.mp4?t=1785319296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>STUNNING VIEW</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221820/extras/2bb96e36c2096c15939ad7871c71b222.poster.avif?t=1785319296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com